      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Colon path:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " ascending colon on the right, hepatic (right colic) flexure under the liver, transverse colon, splenic (left colic) flexure under the spleen, descending colon on the left, then the S-shaped sigmoid colon in the pelvis."
